+/*
+ * zest3: convert F2FS global block address to device-local block address.
+ * In multi-device setups, F2FS block addresses include an offset for the
+ * device's position in the logical address space. This subtracts that
+ * offset so the result is relative to the start of the zoned device.
+ * Returns (unsigned)-1 on error (block not on any zoned device).
